b:T1127,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Trayago?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Trayago is an independent AI-powered travel intelligence platform for Pan-India train journey planning. It offers alternative route discovery, AI Waitlist Rescue, live train running status, GPS train tracking, PNR status checks, confirmation probability estimates, and train schedule information. Trayago is not affiliated with IRCTC or Indian Railways."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Trayago's AI train journey planner work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You enter a departure station, destination, and travel date. Trayago analyses both direct trains and multi-leg alternative route combinations across the Indian railway network, surfacing options with better seat availability — especially useful when direct trains are waitlisted."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is AI Waitlist Rescue?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AI Waitlist Rescue is Trayago's feature for travellers whose preferred direct train is waitlisted or unavailable. The platform analyses alternative route combinations, including split journeys through intermediate stations, that may offer better availability. It does not guarantee a confirmed ticket."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a split train journey?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A split journey uses two or more separate trains to complete a route. Instead of a direct Delhi–Patna service, you could travel Delhi–Kanpur on one train and Kanpur–Patna on another. Each leg requires a separate valid ticket, and total journey time may differ."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Trayago find alternatives when a train is waitlisted?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. When a direct train is heavily waitlisted, Trayago surfaces alternative route combinations with potentially better seat availability. Since availability changes in real time, reviewing and acting on options promptly is recommended."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Trayago book train tickets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Trayago is a journey planning and intelligence platform — it does not issue railway tickets or process payments. Once you decide on a route, you are directed to official booking platforms such as IRCTC to complete the purchase."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Trayago affiliated with IRCTC or Indian Railways?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Trayago is an independent platform and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by IRCTC or Indian Railways. References to IRCTC in this article describe the official government booking service where ticket purchases are completed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Trayago guarantee a confirmed ticket?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Seat availability is dynamic and changes in real time. PNR confirmation probability is an estimate based on historical patterns — not a guarantee. Final confirmation depends on the official IRCTC allocation system."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Trayago PNR prediction work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Trayago uses historical booking and confirmation data from trains with similar route, class, and travel-date characteristics to estimate the probability a waitlisted PNR will confirm. This is a statistical indicator, not a guaranteed outcome."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I check live train running status on Trayago?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Visit trayago.in/live and enter your train number or name. You will see the train's current position, delay status, estimated arrival times at upcoming stations, and a full station-by-station update."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use Trayago for train schedule information?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Trayago provides train timetables with station-wise arrival and departure information across India — useful for planning connections, understanding total journey time, and comparing timing options."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Trayago available across India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Trayago covers the full Pan-India railway network, from major intercity corridors to regional routes across all states and union territories."}}]}a:[["children",{"s":"__PAGE__","h":160,"d":{"r":["$","$2","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[var(--bg-app)] px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"How Trayago's AI Train Journey Planner Makes Indian Rail Travel Smarter\",\"description\":\"Discover how Trayago combines AI route discovery, live train tracking, PNR prediction, and alternative journey options to make Pan-India train travel planning easier.\",\"url\":\"https://www.trayago.in/news/ai-train-journey-planner\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://www.trayago.in/news/ai-train-journey-planner\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-25T06:00:00+05:30\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-25T06:00:00+05:30\",\"articleSection\":\"Feature Guide\",\"image\":[\"https://www.trayago.in/branding/og-image.png\"],\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Trayago\",\"url\":\"https://www.trayago.in\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.trayago.in/branding/og-image.png\"}},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Trayago Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://www.trayago.in\"}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$b"}}],"$Lc","$Ld"]}],null,"$Le"]}],"p":"$@f","v":null,"s":"$7"}}]]
