utes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Trayago queries the train network for direct trains and connecting combinations. Its graph-based route analysis considers journey time, transfer windows, and seat availability patterns."}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"flex gap-4 bg-card/50 border border-subtle rounded-xl p-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center border border-blue-500/20","children":"3"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main mb-1","children":"Discover Alternative Connections"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"If your direct train is waitlisted or unavailable, the platform surfaces viable split journey options. For example, a Delhi–Patna traveller might see an alternative: Delhi → Kanpur → Patna, with better seat availability on each segment."}]]}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"flex gap-4 bg-card/50 border border-subtle rounded-xl p-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center border border-blue-500/20","children":"4"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main mb-1","children":"Review the Recommended Journey"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"You can review complete route details — train names, timing, intermediate stops, and class availability — before making any decision. The comparison is laid out to help you judge whether an alternative is practical for your schedule."}]]}]]}],"$L2e"]}]]}]
1f:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2","children":[["$","$L1c",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z","key":"1xq2db"}]],"className":"lucide-zap w-6 h-6 text-amber-500 shrink-0"}],"AI Waitlist Rescue: What to Do When Your Ticket Is Waitlisted"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"India's railway network carries hundreds of millions of passengers every year, and popular routes during festival seasons, summer holidays, and long weekends can see waitlists of several hundred passengers on a single train. A waitlisted ticket creates real uncertainty: will it confirm? Should you look for alternatives now?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["Trayago's AI Waitlist Rescue addresses this directly. When a direct journey is waitlisted or fully booked, the platform analyses alternative route combinations that may offer better seat availability. Instead of depending entirely on one heavily booked train, you can explore whether a split journey provides a more practical route. A fuller explanation, including when a split journey is and is not worth considering, is on the ",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/ai-waitlist-rescue","className":"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-medium hover:underline","children":"AI Waitlist Rescue"}]," page."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-blue-500/5 dark:bg-blue-950/20 border border-blue-500/20 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 mb-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main mb-3","children":"A practical example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed","children":["You need to travel from ",["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-main","children":"Delhi to Patna"}],". The direct Rajdhani or Sampoorna Kranti is fully waitlisted. Trayago may surface an alternative split journey: ",["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-main","children":"Delhi → Kanpur → Patna"}]," — two trains where seat availability may be better on each segment."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2","children":[["$","$L1c",null,{"iconNode":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["line",{"x1":"12","x2":"12","y1":"8","y2":"12","key":"1pkeuh"}],["line",{"x1":"12","x2":"12.01","y1":"16","y2":"16","key":"4dfq90"}]],"className":"lucide-circle-alert w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400"}],"Important limitations to understand"]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mt-1.5 shrink-0"}],"Availability shown at search time can change before you complete booking — act promptly on alternatives you find."]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mt-1.5 shrink-0"}],"Split journeys require individual tickets for each leg. You must hold a valid ticket for every segment you travel."]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mt-1.5 shrink-0"}],"Trayago does not guarantee confirmed seats. The platform surfaces options — the booking decision is yours."]}],"$L2f"]}]]}]]}]
20:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2","children":[["$","$L1c",null,{"iconNode":[["polygon",{"points":"3 11 22 2 13 21 11 13 3 11","key":"1ltx0t"}]],"className":"lucide-navigation w-6 h-6 text-green-500 shrink-0"}],"Why Alternative Train Routes Can Be Useful"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"The Indian railway network connects over 7,000 stations. Most travellers focus on a handful of named express trains between major cities — but the network contains far more route possibilities than a standard search reveals."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Alternative routes offer more opportunities to find confirmed seats, greater flexibility when your preferred train is booked, and sometimes a timing combination that suits your schedule better. Connecting through a junction city can open up a train route you would never have considered."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed","children":"Trayago does not claim that alternatives are always faster or more convenient. Some split journeys involve longer total travel times or an extra transfer. The platform gives you the information to compare options; the decision is always yours."}]]}]
21:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2","children":[["$","$L1c",null,{"iconNode":"$d:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-tram-front w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 shrink-0"}],"Live Train Running Status and GPS Tracking"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Once your journey is booked, knowing where your train actually is becomes essential. Indian trains can run late due to network congestion, weather, infrastructure maintenance, or scheduled diversions. Checking live train running status before leaving for the station can save you a long, unnecessary wait on the platform."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Trayago's ",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/live","className":"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-medium hover:underline","children":"live train status"}]," tool shows current position information for trains across India. You can see the train's current location between stations, whether it is running on time or delayed, estimated arrival time at your boarding or destination station, and station-by-station progress updates."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed","children":"GPS train tracking is particularly useful for deciding when to leave for the station, keeping people waiting to receive you informed, and monitoring a long-distance train carrying a family member."}]]}]
